WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.737
Carabas was in town, buying flour and salt.

2
00:00:06.738 --> 00:00:14.285
The man waited as Carabas counted out coins.

3
00:00:14.286 --> 00:00:18.799
A basket of dried fish sat on the table.

4
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.210
Carabas saw it and thought of Puss.

5
00:00:22.211 --> 00:00:27.214
"How much for the dried fish?" he asked.

6
00:00:27.215 --> 00:00:30.753
The man told him the price.

7
00:00:30.754 --> 00:00:37.017
"That's too much money," Carabas thought. "Oh well."

8
00:00:37.018 --> 00:00:46.530
He paid for the flour and salt and left.

9
00:00:46.531 --> 00:00:49.653
Carabas was walking home.

10
00:00:49.654 --> 00:00:53.063
Suddenly he stopped.

11
00:00:53.064 --> 00:00:56.670
"Puss is a great cat," Carabas thought.

12
00:00:56.671 --> 00:01:01.350
"I want to do something nice for him."

13
00:01:01.351 --> 00:01:04.632
Carabas ran back to the store.

14
00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:15.502
He bought a dried fish.

15
00:01:15.503 --> 00:01:22.828
Carabas had a long walk home.

16
00:01:22.829 --> 00:01:26.522
One of his shoes ripped.

17
00:01:26.523 --> 00:01:30.899
But Carabas just smiled.

18
00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:37.852
He couldn't wait to give Puss the treat!

19
00:01:37.853 --> 00:01:44.360
Later Puss ate his dried fish.

20
00:01:44.361 --> 00:01:48.564
The cat purred happily.

21
00:01:48.565 --> 00:01:56.944
"I'm glad you like it," Carabas said.

22
00:01:56.945 --> 00:02:01.568
After dinner Carabas counted his coins again.

23
00:02:01.569 --> 00:02:04.833
Each day the pile grew smaller.

24
00:02:04.834 --> 00:02:07.506
"What will I do?" he said.

25
00:02:07.507 --> 00:02:11.231
"How will I eat?"

26
00:02:11.232 --> 00:02:15.141
Puss jumped into his master's lap.

27
00:02:15.142 --> 00:02:20.219
Carabas sighed. "You're lucky, Puss.

28
00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.376
You don't have problems."

29
00:02:23.377 --> 00:02:27.941
"That's not true, Master," Puss said suddenly.

30
00:02:27.942 --> 00:02:30.896
"Your problems are my problems."

31
00:02:30.897 --> 00:02:45.021
Carabas gasped. "Y-you . . . talked!"

